            <ArticleTitle>Treatment of neuropathic orbital pain with gabapentin.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>89-94</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report and discuss a case of severe neuropathic orbital pain refractory to standard analgesics that responded well to treatment with the anticonvulsant gabapentin. Gabapentin may be a useful adjuvant analgesic in the treatment of neuropathic pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
